---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Privacy | TJ Maynes" description="How inquiries, booking information, and website measurement are handled.">
  <main id="main" class="wrap document"><h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>If you email me or book a call, I use the information you provide to respond, schedule, and discuss the work. Please leave passwords, confidential work data, and sensitive personal information out of inquiries.</p>
    <h2>Booking and calls</h2><p>Booking links open Cal.com, which processes your booking under its <a href="https://cal.com/privacy">privacy policy</a>. Links include the service page and button location so I can understand where bookings come from. They do not include your name, email, or task description.</p><p>Recording, transcription, and AI processing of our conversations require a separate discussion and agreement. Booking a call does not grant that permission.</p>
    <h2>Website measurement</h2><p>This site is hosted on Cloudflare. Cloudflare processes requests and may provide aggregate website statistics. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare’s privacy policy</a>.</p>
    <h2>Questions and deletion requests</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:tj@tjmaynes.com">tj@tjmaynes.com</a> to ask about your information or request deletion. Some business records may need to be retained to meet legal or accounting obligations.</p>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
